sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as User
  participant UI as Client UI
  participant NET as Network
  participant S as Server
  U->>UI: Enter credentials
  UI->>NET: Build login packet
  NET->>S: Connect & send login
  S-->>NET: Auth response
  NET-->>UI: Session token
  UI-->>U: Enter game
